Usage: gccli training search [flags]

Search the Garmin catalog of training plans.

Flags:
  -h, --help                     Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json                     Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain                    Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header                   Print the column names as the first line of
                                 --plain output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"             Color mode: auto, always, never ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING           Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"             Unit system for distances, speeds, paces,
                                 elevations and weights in table and plain
                                 output: auto (Garmin profile), metric,
                                 statute_us, statute_uk ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version                  Print version information.

      --sport=STRING             Sport as Garmin prints it in the SPORT column,
                                 such as Running.
      --goal=STRING              Goal as Garmin prints it in the GOAL column,
                                 such as 5k, 10k, HalfMarathon or Marathon.
      --level=STRING             Level as Garmin prints it in the LEVEL column,
                                 such as Beginner, Intermediate or Advanced.
      --target=STRING            Workout target as Garmin prints it in the
                                 TARGET column, such as HeartRate or Time.
      --category=CATEGORY,...    Plan category: FBT_ADAPTIVE (Garmin Coach),
                                 STRENGTH, ITP or STATIC. Repeat the flag or
                                 separate with commas. Default: all categories.
      --locale="en"              Locale for plan names (e.g. en, de, fr).

